{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object visible, approach it and pick it up. Then check properties. Scan area otherwise. Finally, move to random location.      list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    />",
